msgstr ":guilabel:`减速` → 正向 / 反向 → 1/2×、1/4×、1/8×、1/16× — 减慢任一方向的播放速度。"

#: ../clips.rst:336
msgid ":guilabel:`Repeat` — see below."
msgstr ":guilabel:`重复` — 见下文。"

#: ../clips.rst:337
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Freeze` — freezes on the frame at the current playhead position "
