#: ../clips.rst:583
msgid ""
"OpenShot samples both **peak** and **RMS** envelopes at regular time "
"intervals. The lighter outer envelope shows brief peaks and transients; the "
"solid inner envelope shows sustained RMS energy. Both follow the clip's "
"Volume and Time curves and use the same fixed display curve. A subtle center"
" line keeps silent passages identifiable without making them look louder "
"than they are."
msgstr ""
"OpenShot 在固定时间间隔采样**峰值**和**RMS**包络。较浅的外层包络显示短暂峰值和瞬态；实心内层包络显示持续的 RMS "
"能量。两者均遵循剪辑的音量和时间曲线，并使用相同的固定显示曲线。细微的中心线使静音段落可识别，同时不会使其看起来比实际更响亮。"

#: ../clips.rst:588
msgid ""
"New waveforms use 200 samples per second by default, providing several "
"measurements within a typical video frame. Change this density with "
":guilabel:`Edit → Preferences → Timeline → Waveform Samples (per second)`. "
"Higher values show more detail when zoomed in but increase project data size"
" and analysis time. The painter reduces dense data to the visible timeline "
"pixels, and its rendered-waveform cache keeps normal scrolling and "
"repainting inexpensive. Live microphone previews use the selected density "
"and the same peak/RMS display as completed recordings."
msgstr ""
"新波形默认使用每秒 200 个采样，提供典型视频帧内的多个测量。可通过 :guilabel:`编辑 → 首选项 → 时间线 → 波形采样（每秒）` "
"更改此密度。较高值在放大时显示更多细节，但会增加项目数据大小和分析时间。绘制器将密集数据简化为可见时间线像素，其渲染波形缓存保持正常滚动和重绘的低成本。实时麦克风预览使用所选密度和与完成录音相同的峰值/RMS"
" 显示。"

#: ../clips.rst:594
msgid ""
"Projects saved by older OpenShot versions can contain independently peak-"
"normalized waveform data. These waveforms have no format marker, so OpenShot"
" deliberately displays them with the original legacy scaling. They remain "
"familiar instead of becoming unexpectedly thin. Older waveform data without "
"a stored density defaults to its original 20 samples per second, and data "
"without an RMS envelope remains a single solid waveform. A project may "
"safely contain legacy and new waveforms together."
msgstr ""
"由旧版 OpenShot 保存的项目可能包含独立峰值归一化的波形数据。这些波形没有格式标记，因此 OpenShot "
"有意以原始旧版缩放显示它们。它们保持熟悉的外观，而不会意外变细。没有存储密度的旧波形数据默认为每秒 20 个采样，没有 RMS "
"包络的数据保持为单一实心波形。项目可以安全地同时包含旧版和新版波形。"

#: ../clips.rst:600
msgid ""
"To regenerate cached waveform data using the current method, choose "
":guilabel:`Edit → Clear → Waveform Display Data`, then show the waveform "
"again. This affects only cached display data and does not modify the media "
"file or its audio."
msgstr ""
"要使用当前方法重新生成缓存的波形数据，请选择 :guilabel:`编辑 → 清除 → "
"波形显示数据`，然后再次显示波形。这仅影响缓存的显示数据，不会修改媒体文件或其音频。"

#: ../clips.rst:605
